1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,336
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,464
[tense music playing]

3
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:21,813
[screaming]

4
00:00:21,896 --> 00:00:23,773
[shattering sound]

5
00:00:27,318 --> 00:00:29,863
[Arnaldo] <i>The only thing that Diego did</i>
<i>was be a good brother to me.</i>

6
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:32,282
[Emilia] <i>You're coming with me</i>
<i>to meet your grandmother.</i>

7
00:00:32,365 --> 00:00:34,367
<i>I want Diego Torillo's head.</i>

8
00:00:34,451 --> 00:00:36,327
<i>Oh! I have the perfect man for that.</i>

9
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:38,038
<i>The formidable Jaguar.</i>

10
00:00:38,121 --> 00:00:40,040
[Damian] <i>You're facing a very</i>
<i>unpredictable enemy.</i>

11
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:41,041
<i>Red Dragon…</i>

12
00:00:41,124 --> 00:00:44,711
[Mercedes] <i>And this is the gun</i>
<i>I'll be using on Camia and Lily</i>

13
00:00:44,794 --> 00:00:47,672
<i>the moment you defy Red Dragon's orders.</i>

14
00:00:47,756 --> 00:00:49,299
[Emilia] <i>You just said a few words</i>

15
00:00:49,382 --> 00:00:50,300
<i>and left.</i>

16
00:00:50,383 --> 00:00:51,593
[Raul] <i>You need to hide.</i>

17
00:00:51,676 --> 00:00:53,845
<i>Because you're Red Dragon's next target.</i>

18
00:00:53,928 --> 00:00:54,929
<i>I'm not afraid of her.</i>

19
00:00:55,013 --> 00:00:56,181
[Helena] <i>I'm thankful that despite</i>

20
00:00:56,264 --> 00:00:57,807
<i>your differences with my daughter,</i>

21
00:00:57,891 --> 00:00:59,434
<i>we can still be friends.</i>

22
00:00:59,517 --> 00:01:02,687
[Lily] <i>You're like my glamorous</i>
<i>mother that I never had.</i>

23
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:03,730
<i>Hello, Madam.</i>

24
00:01:03,813 --> 00:01:06,691
[Lily] <i>Madam? Who were you talking to?</i>

25
00:01:06,775 --> 00:01:12,655
<i>Are you working for my enemy?</i>
<i>Are you Mercedes Palacio?</i>

26
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:16,034
[man] <i>I'm sorry, ma'am,</i>
<i>but they ganged up on us.</i>

27
00:01:16,117 --> 00:01:17,410
[Helena] <i>I hope nothing comes</i>

28
00:01:17,494 --> 00:01:18,787
<i>between me and Arnaldo next time.</i>

29
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:21,122
<i>And you're right, Emilia.</i>
<i>Diego is a thorn.</i>

30
00:01:21,206 --> 00:01:23,416
<i>So, if you don't do something</i>
<i>about it tonight,</i>

31
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:26,795
<i>then you are the biggest thorn</i>
<i>in this family!</i>

32
00:01:26,878 --> 00:01:29,798
[Natalie] <i>I want to help Lily.</i>

33
00:01:29,881 --> 00:01:30,965
<i>In her fight against the Ardientes.</i>

34
00:01:31,049 --> 00:01:32,759
[Jepoy] <i>All right. If you say so.</i>

35
00:01:32,842 --> 00:01:35,553
[Mercedes] <i>Weren't you tasked with</i>
<i>getting Diego Torillo's head?</i>

36
00:01:35,637 --> 00:01:39,766
<i>Or should I just kill you</i>
<i>together with Camia and Lily?</i>

37
00:01:42,268 --> 00:01:45,939
[pensive music playing]

38
00:02:03,164 --> 00:02:04,666
[dramatic music]

39
00:02:07,001 --> 00:02:09,003
[upbeat music playing]

40
00:02:18,638 --> 00:02:21,266
See you soon, Mercedes Palacio.

41
00:02:34,070 --> 00:02:34,946
Are you hungry?

42
00:02:35,029 --> 00:02:37,157
[Arnaldo] Diego… Oh, it's ready.

43
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:40,034
-Try this.
-Wow. That looks good.

44
00:02:40,118 --> 00:02:41,369
You know how to cook.

45
00:02:42,162 --> 00:02:44,289
Nanny Loring taught me.
Get some rice and try this.

46
00:02:44,372 --> 00:02:46,166
-Okay. I'll try it.
-I'll give you some.

47
00:02:47,041 --> 00:02:48,167
[Arnaldo] What about you?

48
00:02:48,918 --> 00:02:51,921
-Go ahead.
-No. We should eat together.

49
00:02:52,005 --> 00:02:54,507
Here's your plate. I'll get you some rice.

50
00:02:55,758 --> 00:02:57,927
-All right.
-[chuckles]

51
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:01,764
It smells so good.
I've been wanting to try it.

52
00:03:01,848 --> 00:03:02,849
[both chuckle]

53
00:03:04,017 --> 00:03:05,852
-Can I have some rice?
-Here.

54
00:03:07,353 --> 00:03:08,563
I'll get you some.

55
00:03:08,646 --> 00:03:11,566
[soft piano music playing]

56
00:03:13,860 --> 00:03:16,195
-Is this enough?
-That's fine.

57
00:03:18,615 --> 00:03:20,783
Let's have a taste…

58
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:23,161
-Just eat up.
-of Nanny Loring's recipe.

59
00:03:27,457 --> 00:03:28,958
-It's delicious.
-Like it?

60
00:03:29,918 --> 00:03:34,797
It's great. Wait, do I
know how to cook too?

61
00:03:35,256 --> 00:03:36,925
-[Diego] You?
-[Arnaldo] Yeah?

62
00:03:37,008 --> 00:03:38,676
All you know how to do is eat.

63
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,762
-Really? Oh, well.
-[laughs]

64
00:03:40,845 --> 00:03:42,931
[Arnaldo] Hold on. Based on the pictures,

65
00:03:43,014 --> 00:03:45,141
it looked like you were the one
who liked to eat.

66
00:03:45,225 --> 00:03:46,809
[Arnaldo laughs]

67
00:03:46,893 --> 00:03:48,228
You were a bit chubby.

68
00:03:49,103 --> 00:03:50,772
Well, I love a good roast.

69
00:03:50,855 --> 00:03:52,857
Yeah, I can't blame you for that.

70
00:03:53,316 --> 00:03:55,151
[both laughing]

71
00:03:55,235 --> 00:03:56,236
[Arnaldo] But this is really good.

72
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:58,071
[Diego] Thank you, Arnaldo.
I'll teach you how to cook.

73
00:03:58,154 --> 00:04:01,908
But before you do that,
teach me how to chop wood first.

74
00:04:01,991 --> 00:04:05,245
I can't get it… [laughing]

75
00:04:05,328 --> 00:04:06,996
-[Diego] You can do it.
-[laughs]

76
00:04:10,541 --> 00:04:11,542
[Helena sighs]

77
00:04:12,043 --> 00:04:14,545
Well, darling. I have to go.

78
00:04:15,755 --> 00:04:16,756
Okay?

79
00:04:17,757 --> 00:04:18,758
Bye, Mama.

80
00:04:19,509 --> 00:04:24,597
Uh… Mama, don't worry,
our mission is underway.

81
00:04:24,931 --> 00:04:26,641
Oh. That's good.

82
00:04:26,724 --> 00:04:28,851
I knew I could count on you, Emilia.

83
00:04:28,935 --> 00:04:29,936
And… Oh, gosh.

84
00:04:30,019 --> 00:04:32,313
I'm so sorry for my outburst earlier.

85
00:04:32,397 --> 00:04:34,274
I did it for your own good.

86
00:04:36,025 --> 00:04:37,568
How can I make it up to you?

87
00:04:39,445 --> 00:04:40,446
Um…

88
00:04:41,864 --> 00:04:43,700
Let's have Lily Cruz killed.

89
00:04:43,783 --> 00:04:45,702
[ominous music]

90
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:51,124
[suspenseful music playing]

91
00:04:53,251 --> 00:04:55,128
[upbeat music playing]

92
00:05:05,054 --> 00:05:07,598
[Mercedes] Well, it was
really fun talking with you.

93
00:05:07,890 --> 00:05:09,600
Yeah. I had fun.

94
00:05:13,187 --> 00:05:17,066
If you want, we can keep
going and have fun all night.

95
00:05:17,150 --> 00:05:19,027
[man] Hmm… Interesting.

96
00:05:19,110 --> 00:05:22,363
[upbeat music playing]

97
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,578
[both giggling]

98
00:05:28,661 --> 00:05:29,871
Now, you go.

99
00:05:34,917 --> 00:05:35,710
No.

100
00:05:36,544 --> 00:05:37,628
What, Mama?!

101
00:05:38,004 --> 00:05:41,382
How can we not do that?
She's the enemy here, Mama!

102
00:05:42,383 --> 00:05:47,221
[sighs] Darling, now's
not the right time to kill Lily.

103
00:05:47,889 --> 00:05:48,848
Wow, Mama.

104
00:05:48,931 --> 00:05:51,059
You guys are on a first-name basis?

105
00:05:51,142 --> 00:05:55,271
[sighs] Looks like you really
enjoyed your lunch with her.

106
00:05:56,272 --> 00:05:59,817
Well, I must admit, she is a lovely girl.

107
00:06:00,193 --> 00:06:03,237
But she's too simple for our taste.

108
00:06:03,321 --> 00:06:06,449
You are far more beautiful
and fabulous than her.

109
00:06:08,451 --> 00:06:09,368
Please, my darling,

110
00:06:09,452 --> 00:06:12,872
don't worry about
the existence of Lily Cruz.

111
00:06:12,955 --> 00:06:16,042
Okay? We'll take our time.

112
00:06:16,501 --> 00:06:18,377
It's more fun that way. [chuckles]

113
00:06:19,962 --> 00:06:21,464
-Bye, Mama.
-Bye.

114
00:06:21,547 --> 00:06:26,761
[dramatic music playing]

115
00:06:35,561 --> 00:06:36,896
[both laughing]

116
00:06:37,855 --> 00:06:41,818
-What were you saying?
-Anyway, I have to go.

117
00:06:41,901 --> 00:06:43,653
-No, no, no! Don't worry.
-Wait, I'll take care of that.

118
00:06:43,736 --> 00:06:45,947
I got this. I can take care of this.

119
00:06:46,614 --> 00:06:47,365
I'm all right.

120
00:06:47,448 --> 00:06:50,159
-Are you sure? Let me help you.
-It's very late. You have to go.

121
00:06:50,243 --> 00:06:51,494
I'm all right.

122
00:06:51,577 --> 00:06:52,662
-I have to go.
-Thank you.

123
00:06:52,745 --> 00:06:54,997
-See you tomorrow.
-Okay.

124
00:06:55,081 --> 00:06:56,165
Take care.

125
00:06:56,707 --> 00:06:57,708
Okay, Arnaldo.

126
00:06:59,877 --> 00:07:00,878
[Diego] Good night.

127
00:07:01,337 --> 00:07:02,922
Good night. [chuckles]

128
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:11,514
[ominous music]

129
00:07:15,601 --> 00:07:18,688
[suspenseful music playing]

130
00:07:23,609 --> 00:07:24,944
What are you doing here?

131
00:07:25,736 --> 00:07:29,031
Say your prayers
because you're about to die.

132
00:07:29,490 --> 00:07:30,450
[grunts]

133
00:07:36,998 --> 00:07:40,793
[suspenseful music continues]

134
00:07:44,922 --> 00:07:45,923
[groaning]

135
00:07:47,967 --> 00:07:49,010
Take him.

136
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:06,903
[suspenseful music continues]

137
00:08:20,625 --> 00:08:21,626
[sighs]

138
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,130
[Lily] Oh, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

139
00:08:26,464 --> 00:08:27,340
[moans]

140
00:08:27,423 --> 00:08:30,426
-[man] Hey, are you okay?
-[Lily] Sorry. Sorry.

141
00:08:31,385 --> 00:08:34,931
-[man] Are you okay?
-[Lily giggling] Yes. I'm sorry.

142
00:08:35,014 --> 00:08:36,015
[elevator opens]

143
00:08:36,766 --> 00:08:37,600
[Lily] Sorry.

144
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,481
[chuckles]

145
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:50,112
[tense music playing]

146
00:08:52,114 --> 00:08:53,115
[elevator dings]

147
00:08:57,370 --> 00:09:00,915
[action music playing]

148
00:09:08,464 --> 00:09:09,882
-Put him there.
-[Diego panting]

149
00:09:11,968 --> 00:09:13,678
I'm sorry.
I didn't want to do this to you.

150
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:18,182
[suspenseful music]

151
00:09:22,353 --> 00:09:23,938
Did Red Dragon order you to kill me?

152
00:09:26,023 --> 00:09:27,191
Want do you want from me?!

153
00:09:27,275 --> 00:09:30,027
[woman] You talk too much.
Jaguar, finish him off!

154
00:09:31,946 --> 00:09:34,824
[suspenseful music continues]

155
00:09:53,509 --> 00:09:55,386
[gunshots]

156
00:10:04,895 --> 00:10:07,106
[Damian] You're here again, fake Jaguar?!

157
00:10:09,942 --> 00:10:12,486
Let Diego go!
He has nothing to do with this!

158
00:10:13,029 --> 00:10:15,031
[suspenseful music]

159
00:10:15,823 --> 00:10:17,408
[Damian] You confuse me.

160
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:21,662
One moment, you're a criminal.
Now, you're a vigilante?

161
00:10:21,746 --> 00:10:23,372
Let Diego go!

162
00:10:23,706 --> 00:10:25,750
-[gunfire]
-[Raul groans]

163
00:10:26,292 --> 00:10:28,085
-[woman groans]
-[gunfire continues]

164
00:10:28,836 --> 00:10:30,129
Diego! Run!

165
00:10:32,381 --> 00:10:35,635
[gunfire continues]

166
00:10:37,345 --> 00:10:40,514
[Damian] Go after Diego!
I'll deal with that impostor!

167
00:10:40,973 --> 00:10:42,058
[Raul panting]

168
00:10:46,103 --> 00:10:47,104
[suspenseful music]

169
00:10:56,572 --> 00:10:58,616
-[suspenseful music]
-[Diego panting]

170
00:11:18,511 --> 00:11:21,639
[suspenseful music playing]

171
00:11:36,404 --> 00:11:37,738
[heavy breathing]

172
00:11:40,116 --> 00:11:42,284
[suspenseful music continues]

173
00:11:49,750 --> 00:11:50,960
[both grunt]

174
00:11:55,881 --> 00:11:56,966
[grunting]

175
00:12:06,517 --> 00:12:08,936
Wait! What do you want from me?!

176
00:12:09,478 --> 00:12:10,896
[woman] We're here to kill you!

177
00:12:12,898 --> 00:12:14,608
[grunting]

178
00:12:17,736 --> 00:12:18,863
[groaning]

179
00:12:21,365 --> 00:12:22,741
-[Diego grunts]
-[woman groans]

180
00:12:27,997 --> 00:12:29,957
[suspenseful music playing]

181
00:12:30,875 --> 00:12:32,918
Did you really think it'd be that easy?

182
00:12:33,002 --> 00:12:34,795
[woman] What are you waiting for, Jaguar?

183
00:12:35,546 --> 00:12:37,756
-Kill him!
-I'm on it!

184
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,841
[gunshot]

185
00:12:42,887 --> 00:12:43,971
Go on.

186
00:12:48,350 --> 00:12:49,685
I said, leave!

187
00:12:56,233 --> 00:12:58,652
Why are you stopping?! Search over there!

188
00:13:05,075 --> 00:13:08,370
[suspenseful music swelling]

189
00:13:12,208 --> 00:13:14,251
[Diego panting]

190
00:13:16,629 --> 00:13:17,671
[Raul groans]

191
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:19,381
[Raul groans]

192
00:13:21,467 --> 00:13:22,468
[Raul growls]

193
00:13:30,726 --> 00:13:33,187
[Raul] <i>Let Diego go!</i>
<i>He has nothing to do with this!</i>

194
00:13:33,270 --> 00:13:34,897
-[gunshot]
-[Raul groans]

195
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:36,690
-<i>Diego, run!</i>
-[gunfire]

196
00:13:47,368 --> 00:13:50,371
[suspenseful music playing]

197
00:14:03,217 --> 00:14:06,220
[dramatic music playing]

198
00:14:13,185 --> 00:14:14,144
Dad?

199
00:14:16,855 --> 00:14:18,023
You're the Jaguar?

200
00:14:21,485 --> 00:14:23,487
[heavy breathing]

201
00:14:29,869 --> 00:14:32,872
[slow instrumental playing]

202
00:14:35,875 --> 00:14:37,167
[water pouring]

203
00:14:44,466 --> 00:14:45,301
[muffled screams]

204
00:14:45,384 --> 00:14:47,136
[Rufo] <i>Diego, let's get out of here.</i>

205
00:14:47,219 --> 00:14:48,304
-[Rufo] <i>Come on!</i>
-[Diego] <i>Who are you?</i>

206
00:14:48,387 --> 00:14:50,306
<i>-We're Jaguar's men.</i>
<i>-Who's Jaguar?</i>

207
00:14:50,389 --> 00:14:52,057
<i>You'll find out soon enough. Let's go.</i>

208
00:14:52,141 --> 00:14:53,684
<i>I'm not going with you!</i>

209
00:14:53,767 --> 00:14:55,978
<i>You really are stubborn. Jaguar was right.</i>

210
00:14:56,228 --> 00:14:58,063
[Diego] <i>Wait! Who's Jaguar?!</i>

211
00:15:08,908 --> 00:15:10,326
[Diego] <i>What do you want from me?</i>

212
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:13,162
[Rufo] <i>Given your situation,</i>
<i>you're the one who needs him.</i>

213
00:15:13,245 --> 00:15:15,789
<i>He's going to help you run for governor.</i>

214
00:15:15,873 --> 00:15:18,042
[Diego] <i>First of all, I don't trust anyone</i>

215
00:15:18,125 --> 00:15:20,920
<i>who hides their face</i>
<i>and doesn't choose to talk.</i>

216
00:15:22,755 --> 00:15:24,131
[groaning]

217
00:15:27,509 --> 00:15:29,136
[Raul] <i>You need allies.</i>
<i>Someone on your side.</i>

218
00:15:29,219 --> 00:15:31,805
<i>You need the protection of strong people.</i>

219
00:15:31,889 --> 00:15:32,640
<i>Like Jaguar.</i>

220
00:15:32,723 --> 00:15:35,935
<i>If he protects you,</i>
<i>you'll be ruling over Ardiente.</i>

221
00:15:36,018 --> 00:15:38,687
<i>Hang on, Dad. Do you know Jaguar?</i>

222
00:15:38,771 --> 00:15:40,147
<i>Why do you want me to side with him?</i>

223
00:15:40,230 --> 00:15:41,899
<i>Are you working together?</i>

224
00:15:46,570 --> 00:15:47,613
[groans]

225
00:15:49,531 --> 00:15:51,533
[panting]

226
00:16:09,176 --> 00:16:11,220
[upbeat music playing]

227
00:16:29,905 --> 00:16:31,573
[sprays]

228
00:16:35,869 --> 00:16:37,871
[tense music playing]

229
00:16:45,129 --> 00:16:46,130
[beeps]

230
00:17:10,863 --> 00:17:12,865
[ominous music playing]

231
00:17:26,003 --> 00:17:28,005
[tense music playing]

232
00:18:07,294 --> 00:18:08,253
[suspenseful sting]

233
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,641
[error alert]

234
00:18:26,730 --> 00:18:30,400
[slow instrumental playing]

235
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:39,368
[groans]

236
00:18:39,993 --> 00:18:41,120
Where am I?

237
00:18:43,247 --> 00:18:44,665
We're safe here.

238
00:18:50,963 --> 00:18:52,214
Dad, tell me the truth.

239
00:18:55,759 --> 00:18:56,927
Are you the Jaguar?

240
00:19:06,353 --> 00:19:07,354
Yes.

241
00:19:08,897 --> 00:19:09,982
I'm the Jaguar.

242
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:13,944
So that's why you helped set me free.

243
00:19:14,862 --> 00:19:16,613
Listen to me, Diego.

244
00:19:20,284 --> 00:19:21,785
I'm doing all this…

245
00:19:23,287 --> 00:19:25,455
because it's the only way for me…

246
00:19:26,874 --> 00:19:28,333
to protect you.

247
00:19:32,921 --> 00:19:33,964
What about the scandals?

248
00:19:34,965 --> 00:19:37,593
The gambling dens?
Were you behind all those?

249
00:19:39,636 --> 00:19:42,890
Dad, I gave up everything for this town.

250
00:19:42,973 --> 00:19:45,684
I even risked my own life.
But what did you do?

251
00:19:46,768 --> 00:19:47,895
You're all the same.

252
00:19:48,770 --> 00:19:52,399
You're no different from the Ardientes!

253
00:19:56,737 --> 00:19:58,906
Say what you want, Diego.

254
00:20:00,991 --> 00:20:02,284
Yes, I admit it.

255
00:20:03,744 --> 00:20:05,913
But I only wear that mask…

256
00:20:08,874 --> 00:20:10,292
to guarantee your safety,

257
00:20:11,251 --> 00:20:15,255
to keep you from danger, to protect you.

258
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:18,550
And no matter what you say…

259
00:20:20,928 --> 00:20:22,804
I never hurt you.

260
00:20:24,264 --> 00:20:25,933
And now, I wore that mask again

261
00:20:26,016 --> 00:20:28,602
to keep you safe from Red Dragon.

262
00:20:34,733 --> 00:20:37,694
[slow instrumental playing]

263
00:20:54,211 --> 00:20:57,256
-[suspenseful music playing]
-[keys clicking]

264
00:20:59,007 --> 00:20:59,841
[error alert]

265
00:21:04,137 --> 00:21:05,138
[error alert]

266
00:21:16,608 --> 00:21:17,609
[error alert]

267
00:21:18,610 --> 00:21:21,613
[suspenseful music playing]

268
00:21:26,618 --> 00:21:28,120
[mechanical sound]

269
00:21:28,870 --> 00:21:30,664
[keys clicking]

270
00:21:38,505 --> 00:21:39,506
[beeps]

271
00:21:48,140 --> 00:21:50,142
[tense music intensifies]

272
00:22:08,744 --> 00:22:12,914
Mercedes Palacio and Helena Montoya.

273
00:22:24,468 --> 00:22:27,596
[unsettling music playing]

274
00:22:51,953 --> 00:22:53,747
[Raul] <i>I wear that mask</i>

275
00:22:55,373 --> 00:22:57,000
<i>to guarantee your safety,</i>

276
00:22:57,959 --> 00:23:01,880
<i>to keep you from danger, to protect you.</i>

277
00:23:03,381 --> 00:23:07,594
<i>I wore that mask again</i>
<i>to keep you safe from Red Dragon.</i>

278
00:23:12,474 --> 00:23:13,892
[Diego] <i>This gold mask…</i>

279
00:23:14,601 --> 00:23:17,104
<i>This is the key to Red Dragon's world.</i>

280
00:23:26,738 --> 00:23:29,741
[dramatic music playing]

281
00:24:00,355 --> 00:24:02,190
[upbeat music playing]

282
00:24:04,025 --> 00:24:04,943
-Oh.
-[man] Hi.

283
00:24:05,026 --> 00:24:07,946
-Why did you come back?
-The key card.

284
00:24:08,989 --> 00:24:10,282
I think I lost it.

285
00:24:15,871 --> 00:24:17,914
[suspenseful music playing]

286
00:24:29,509 --> 00:24:30,510
Excuse me.

287
00:24:38,393 --> 00:24:40,937
[suspenseful music playing]

288
00:24:47,068 --> 00:24:48,987
[phone rings]

289
00:24:56,995 --> 00:24:58,872
[phone rings]

290
00:25:01,625 --> 00:25:02,709
[Helena] <i>Hello? Finally!</i>

291
00:25:03,251 --> 00:25:04,961
Mercedes, I can't reach you
on your cellphone.

292
00:25:05,045 --> 00:25:07,839
<i>I've been trying to call you.</i>
<i>You need to report to me ASAP.</i>

293
00:25:13,178 --> 00:25:14,721
Hello? Mercedes?

294
00:25:14,804 --> 00:25:15,972
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

295
00:25:16,765 --> 00:25:18,975
[Lily] <i>I hear you loud and clear.</i>

296
00:25:19,059 --> 00:25:22,187
<i>There's no mistaking it.</i>

297
00:25:22,270 --> 00:25:24,147
<i>I know it's you.</i>

298
00:25:24,231 --> 00:25:30,111
<i>You, Helena Montoya, are none</i>
<i>other than Red Dragon!</i>

299
00:25:30,195 --> 00:25:32,030
[suspenseful music]

300
00:25:40,872 --> 00:25:45,126
Helena Montoya as Red Dragon.

301
00:25:46,211 --> 00:25:47,212
[thumps]

302
00:25:52,133 --> 00:25:54,970
And now, my enemy finally has a face.

303
00:25:56,263 --> 00:25:57,222
[door slowly opens]

304
00:25:57,305 --> 00:25:59,849
[suspenseful music continues]

305
00:26:01,059 --> 00:26:02,102
[door closes]

306
00:26:38,930 --> 00:26:39,931
[suspenseful sting]

307
00:26:56,489 --> 00:26:59,492
[tense music playing]

308
00:27:10,253 --> 00:27:13,256
[suspenseful music playing]

309
00:27:22,766 --> 00:27:25,727
[dramatic music playing]

310
00:27:36,488 --> 00:27:39,491
[tense music playing]

311
00:28:19,864 --> 00:28:20,865
[groans]

312
00:28:26,121 --> 00:28:27,122
[sighs]

313
00:28:37,382 --> 00:28:38,383
Give me that.

314
00:28:45,390 --> 00:28:46,433
[exhales]

315
00:28:53,982 --> 00:28:54,983
[Helena] Mercedes.

316
00:28:56,109 --> 00:28:58,528
Has Diego Torillo been dispatched?

317
00:29:00,697 --> 00:29:03,241
Remember, it's my daughter's request.

318
00:29:04,367 --> 00:29:05,368
[Mercedes sighs]

319
00:29:06,161 --> 00:29:09,122
Still no update from the Dragon
Ladies who went after Diego.

320
00:29:09,873 --> 00:29:12,959
But until now, they haven't
found him in the area.

321
00:29:14,377 --> 00:29:18,047
That doesn't mean to say
that Diego's dead.

322
00:29:21,926 --> 00:29:24,804
If you had only answered my call earlier…

323
00:29:27,140 --> 00:29:29,517
you wouldn't have to report this to me.

324
00:29:34,522 --> 00:29:35,774
You don't know?

325
00:29:37,942 --> 00:29:41,613
Then tell me, who answered the phone?

326
00:29:43,239 --> 00:29:44,491
Were you with someone?

327
00:29:50,914 --> 00:29:54,167
You know I do not
tolerate daftness, Mercedes.

328
00:29:54,250 --> 00:29:55,835
Tell me the truth.

329
00:29:58,171 --> 00:29:59,547
Were you with someone?

330
00:30:01,758 --> 00:30:03,134
Yes, Madam.

331
00:30:04,761 --> 00:30:10,141
And I did not answer because I was wasted.

332
00:30:12,435 --> 00:30:15,730
[laughing]

333
00:30:16,356 --> 00:30:17,315
[gasps]

334
00:30:17,398 --> 00:30:19,317
[Helena continues laughing]

335
00:30:24,531 --> 00:30:28,284
They don't call me Red Dragon
for nothing, Mercedes!

336
00:30:28,368 --> 00:30:31,371
And you, of all people, should know this!

337
00:30:31,454 --> 00:30:37,252
I will burn you, and I will be
your personal hell…

338
00:30:38,169 --> 00:30:41,881
especially if I find out
that you're lying to me

339
00:30:41,965 --> 00:30:45,885
even with the most microscopic detail.

340
00:30:45,969 --> 00:30:50,974
Or else, I'll be forced
to use this on you.

341
00:30:52,600 --> 00:30:58,064
Now, you wouldn't want that,
Mercedes. Would you?

342
00:31:02,318 --> 00:31:04,362
[ominous music]

343
00:31:08,867 --> 00:31:14,038
If Helena is Red Dragon,
and she's Emilia's mother,

344
00:31:14,831 --> 00:31:17,876
then her mother is a corrupt criminal.

345
00:31:18,585 --> 00:31:19,544
[Camia chuckles]

346
00:31:19,627 --> 00:31:22,255
Even a family of demons
can't hold a candle to them!

347
00:31:26,259 --> 00:31:28,845
I don't care if Emilia really
is her daughter

348
00:31:28,928 --> 00:31:30,555
or whoever she is.

349
00:31:30,638 --> 00:31:34,684
What's important is that
I finally know who my enemy is.

350
00:31:34,767 --> 00:31:36,394
That Red Dragon,

351
00:31:36,477 --> 00:31:40,231
or Helena Montoya, better be ready.

352
00:31:40,899 --> 00:31:44,527
Because I will ruin her
machinery, expose her secrets,

353
00:31:44,611 --> 00:31:49,240
and destroy her the way
she destroyed my properties!

354
00:31:52,201 --> 00:31:57,832
I will fight her in the way
only Lily Cruz can.

355
00:31:59,918 --> 00:32:01,169
Red Dragon.

356
00:32:02,837 --> 00:32:05,840
You better start hiding in your lair.

357
00:32:06,883 --> 00:32:10,094
[dramatic music]

358
00:32:18,186 --> 00:32:20,229
[foreboding music playing]

359
00:32:51,094 --> 00:32:52,220
What are you watching?

360
00:32:55,974 --> 00:32:57,976
Red Dragon is waiting for you.

361
00:33:01,229 --> 00:33:03,231
[dramatic music playing]

362
00:33:03,856 --> 00:33:06,234
-[Emilia] Hi, Mama.
-Emilia, darling.

363
00:33:14,242 --> 00:33:18,329
Mama, an enemy out there is watching you.

364
00:33:19,247 --> 00:33:21,124
They're waiting to destroy you.

365
00:33:21,916 --> 00:33:23,668
I'm sure whoever was on the other line

366
00:33:23,751 --> 00:33:25,503
plans to take you down.

367
00:33:26,713 --> 00:33:27,672
Then, they should try me…

368
00:33:29,382 --> 00:33:31,092
if they want to be reduced to ashes.

369
00:33:31,509 --> 00:33:32,677
[sighs]

370
00:33:32,760 --> 00:33:37,015
You're being paranoid, my dear.
Nothing has even happened yet.

371
00:33:38,016 --> 00:33:40,560
Mama. You are in Ardiente.

372
00:33:40,643 --> 00:33:43,521
Everyone else here
is backstabbing each other.

373
00:33:43,604 --> 00:33:45,273
So, you have to watch your back, Mama.

374
00:33:45,940 --> 00:33:49,569
That Mercedes. Are you sure
you can really trust her?

375
00:33:50,403 --> 00:33:51,487
[sighs]

376
00:33:52,572 --> 00:33:57,618
And Lily Cruz may be aware
that you are Red Dragon.

377
00:33:58,119 --> 00:33:59,120
[laughs]

378
00:33:59,370 --> 00:34:00,663
Emilia, sweetheart.

379
00:34:00,747 --> 00:34:03,916
You really have an overactive imagination.

380
00:34:04,250 --> 00:34:06,169
But we're not playing charades.

381
00:34:06,627 --> 00:34:09,130
I have to be dead sure about my target…

382
00:34:09,922 --> 00:34:11,924
before I waste my time on them.

383
00:34:13,426 --> 00:34:14,552
Remember,

384
00:34:15,261 --> 00:34:17,305
anyone who battles a dragon

385
00:34:17,764 --> 00:34:20,224
should be ready to die in a blaze.

386
00:34:20,308 --> 00:34:23,686
[dramatic music playing]

387
00:34:30,109 --> 00:34:35,031
Is what Lily said about Helena Montoya

388
00:34:35,114 --> 00:34:36,240
being Red Dragon true?

389
00:34:36,324 --> 00:34:39,368
The Red Dragon that bombed her businesses?

390
00:34:39,452 --> 00:34:41,788
-[Anna] Jepoy.
-She doesn't look like it.

391
00:34:41,871 --> 00:34:44,290
I mean, she seems so kind.

392
00:34:45,625 --> 00:34:47,293
[Anna] Yes, Mr. Pandoy, Miss Loring.

393
00:34:47,877 --> 00:34:49,670
That's why we should be careful.

394
00:34:49,754 --> 00:34:54,050
We shouldn't trust her or what
the media says about her.

395
00:34:54,592 --> 00:34:56,469
[Jepoy] We have a powerful enemy.

396
00:34:57,512 --> 00:35:00,556
She's as powerful as two Ardiente families

397
00:35:00,640 --> 00:35:02,225
in their prime.

398
00:35:06,229 --> 00:35:08,106
We might need another ally.

399
00:35:16,864 --> 00:35:17,865
[Diego] <i>What?</i>

400
00:35:18,741 --> 00:35:20,576
Helena Montoya is Red Dragon?

401
00:35:20,660 --> 00:35:21,786
Yes.

402
00:35:22,453 --> 00:35:24,122
That woman really is something.

403
00:35:24,205 --> 00:35:25,915
She thought she could fool me?

404
00:35:25,998 --> 00:35:29,836
She doesn't know how easily I use
my hands to play with fire

405
00:35:29,919 --> 00:35:32,380
and how I'll play her for a sap.

406
00:35:32,922 --> 00:35:34,674
We need to expose her.

407
00:35:35,633 --> 00:35:36,926
Not yet, Diego.

408
00:35:37,009 --> 00:35:39,095
<i>I need stronger evidence.</i>

409
00:35:39,512 --> 00:35:40,847
Then she'll go to prison

410
00:35:40,930 --> 00:35:45,351
and pay for what she did to Aguas Realty.

411
00:35:53,860 --> 00:35:55,611
<i>Did Red Dragon order you to kill me?</i>

412
00:35:58,489 --> 00:35:59,782
I've got an idea.

413
00:36:01,075 --> 00:36:04,829
Whatever that is, Diego,
all right, I trust you.

414
00:36:04,912 --> 00:36:06,497
[Diego] <i>I'm confident…</i>

415
00:36:06,747 --> 00:36:09,000
that I can infiltrate
Red Dragon's hideout.

416
00:36:09,625 --> 00:36:11,669
If you can, then I need to know

417
00:36:11,752 --> 00:36:14,672
about Helena Montoya's other transactions,

418
00:36:14,922 --> 00:36:18,926
as the one and only Red Dragon.

419
00:36:24,765 --> 00:36:26,642
[tense music playing]

420
00:36:31,898 --> 00:36:33,900
[indistinct chatter]

421
00:36:35,985 --> 00:36:39,280
-[Loring] There she is.
-Miss Loring, Mr. Pandoy.

422
00:36:39,363 --> 00:36:42,658
-[Pandoy] Lily. Yeah.
-How is--Where's Diego?

423
00:36:42,742 --> 00:36:46,162
Um, he had to take care
of something important.

424
00:36:46,245 --> 00:36:48,956
But don't worry. He'll come home.

425
00:36:50,082 --> 00:36:51,042
Should we go?

426
00:36:51,125 --> 00:36:55,838
Uh… About your information on Red Dragon.

427
00:36:55,922 --> 00:37:01,427
You know we're Team Lily all the way.

428
00:37:01,510 --> 00:37:02,511
[Pandoy] That's true.

429
00:37:03,012 --> 00:37:04,013
Thank you.

430
00:37:05,097 --> 00:37:09,852
Now you know why I needed to be
at her medical mission.

431
00:37:12,647 --> 00:37:13,648
Should we go in?

432
00:37:13,731 --> 00:37:15,149
-[Pandoy] Sure.
-[Loring] Let's go.

433
00:37:15,900 --> 00:37:16,901
[Pandoy] You go first.

434
00:37:17,902 --> 00:37:18,819
[Helena] Thank you.

435
00:37:18,903 --> 00:37:22,823
Good morning, dear residents of Ardiente.

436
00:37:22,907 --> 00:37:25,826
This morning, we have a medical mission

437
00:37:25,910 --> 00:37:31,374
for all kinds of illnesses that
you might be suffering from.

438
00:37:31,457 --> 00:37:32,375
Please come in.

439
00:37:32,458 --> 00:37:34,835
Oh, she's finally here! Miss Lily Cruz!

440
00:37:34,919 --> 00:37:35,836
-[Lily] Helena.
-[applause]

441
00:37:35,920 --> 00:37:39,548
[Helena] Let's give her
and her posse a round of applause.

442
00:37:39,632 --> 00:37:43,177
Come here. Don't be shy. [laughs]

443
00:37:43,261 --> 00:37:46,806
-Good morning to all of you.
-[Pandoy coughing]

444
00:37:46,889 --> 00:37:50,643
Oh, oh, no. Do you have a cough?

445
00:37:50,726 --> 00:37:53,896
-What?
-Come here. What's your name?

446
00:37:53,980 --> 00:37:57,525
-Pandoy, ma'am.
-Come here, Mr. Pandoy.

447
00:37:57,608 --> 00:38:00,903
You're coughing. Do you feel sick?

448
00:38:00,987 --> 00:38:04,282
-Uh… No, ma'am.
-[Helena] But you're coughing.

449
00:38:04,365 --> 00:38:07,034
How long has this been going on?

450
00:38:07,743 --> 00:38:13,416
[Pandoy] Uh… Well, I get dizzy
when the sun is up, but--

451
00:38:13,499 --> 00:38:18,170
Well, you're in luck because
we have a pulmonary expert.

452
00:38:18,254 --> 00:38:21,799
Please see Dr. Santos. She'll help you.

453
00:38:21,882 --> 00:38:25,553
Make sure this man gets
the attention that he needs.

454
00:38:25,636 --> 00:38:28,848
Everybody, fall in line. Come on.

455
00:38:28,931 --> 00:38:32,226
This is just the beginning, dear friends.

456
00:38:32,310 --> 00:38:36,772
And also, to those with dental needs.

457
00:38:36,856 --> 00:38:41,152
Next time, I'll bring
dentists here to you.

458
00:38:41,235 --> 00:38:44,780
Remember: onward, Ardiente!

459
00:38:50,119 --> 00:38:51,120
Huh?

460
00:38:51,912 --> 00:38:52,913
Boring news.

461
00:38:57,001 --> 00:38:58,252
Oh! Hi, Papa.

462
00:38:59,503 --> 00:39:02,798
-Hi, Emilia.
-Do you need anything?

463
00:39:02,882 --> 00:39:06,302
I so know you, Papa.
You're dying to ask me a favor.

464
00:39:06,385 --> 00:39:07,928
What is it that you need?

465
00:39:09,972 --> 00:39:10,973
Fine.

466
00:39:12,767 --> 00:39:15,186
I want you to tell me
where I can find your mother.

467
00:39:16,729 --> 00:39:17,813
Hmm…

468
00:39:17,897 --> 00:39:19,648
I'm not gonna do that. I can't.

469
00:39:20,483 --> 00:39:25,112
Yeah, right. Come on,
just give me her address.

470
00:39:26,072 --> 00:39:29,492
It's not as if she's the queen
of the underworld.

471
00:39:30,910 --> 00:39:33,120
Emilia, if you don't want
to give me her address,

472
00:39:33,204 --> 00:39:35,539
then just please call her.

473
00:39:36,874 --> 00:39:39,460
Papa, Mama doesn't want you anymore.

474
00:39:39,543 --> 00:39:41,295
Please call her!

475
00:39:41,379 --> 00:39:42,380
Okay.

476
00:39:45,341 --> 00:39:46,842
[man] If you have any problems
just tell me.

477
00:39:46,926 --> 00:39:48,511
-[phone ringing]
-Oh. Excuse me.

478
00:39:48,928 --> 00:39:50,179
Hello, Emilia.

479
00:39:50,262 --> 00:39:51,430
[Emilia] <i>Hello, Mama.</i>

480
00:39:52,014 --> 00:39:53,307
Where are you?

481
00:39:53,391 --> 00:39:57,812
I'm endearing myself
to the masses, darling.

482
00:39:57,895 --> 00:39:59,647
Mama, you're not supposed to do that.

483
00:39:59,730 --> 00:40:01,440
You should find the enemy.

484
00:40:01,524 --> 00:40:05,861
Don't worry, Emilia.
I can handle things, okay?

485
00:40:05,945 --> 00:40:08,572
Anyway, Papa's looking for you.

486
00:40:08,656 --> 00:40:10,741
He said you were going to meet.

487
00:40:11,492 --> 00:40:12,785
[laughs]

488
00:40:13,869 --> 00:40:17,498
Well. Hmm. Tell him to wait tonight.

489
00:40:17,581 --> 00:40:19,834
<i>Okay? All right, I have to go.</i>

490
00:40:19,917 --> 00:40:23,462
Lily Cruz has her eye on me.

491
00:40:23,921 --> 00:40:25,881
Lily Cruz? You're with her?

492
00:40:26,215 --> 00:40:28,801
Yes. Okay then, I have to go.

493
00:40:28,884 --> 00:40:30,553
<i>Bye. Be a good girl.</i>

494
00:40:30,636 --> 00:40:31,971
Okay, Mama. You too.

495
00:40:32,763 --> 00:40:33,931
[dramatic music]

496
00:40:34,890 --> 00:40:39,520
She told you to wait.
But I won't. Excuse me, Papa.

497
00:40:47,111 --> 00:40:49,864
She's with Lily Cruz?

498
00:40:53,742 --> 00:40:55,828
[Camia] Okay. Please get the car ready.

499
00:40:55,911 --> 00:40:57,121
-Okay, ma'am.
-Thank you.

500
00:40:59,915 --> 00:41:00,916
Damian.

501
00:41:01,500 --> 00:41:03,919
Are you not coming to the medical mission?

502
00:41:04,545 --> 00:41:06,922
Helena Montoya is the one behind that.

503
00:41:07,006 --> 00:41:09,675
Lily suspects she's a criminal, right?

504
00:41:10,509 --> 00:41:12,636
Wouldn't it be too dangerous
for you there?

505
00:41:13,762 --> 00:41:15,181
[sighs] If that's the case,

506
00:41:16,515 --> 00:41:18,350
Lily needs me there with her.

507
00:41:18,934 --> 00:41:21,896
Damian, she's my daughter.
Her enemy is my enemy too.

508
00:41:21,979 --> 00:41:24,690
If she gets hurt, I will be there for her.

509
00:41:25,941 --> 00:41:28,068
Because my daughter
and I share the same fate.

510
00:41:31,947 --> 00:41:33,657
Are you sure you're not coming?

511
00:41:35,367 --> 00:41:36,952
I'm feeling a little sick today.

512
00:41:38,370 --> 00:41:39,371
What?

513
00:41:41,248 --> 00:41:43,250
[slow instrumental playing]

514
00:41:43,876 --> 00:41:45,669
Well, you aren't burning up.

515
00:41:46,045 --> 00:41:49,465
No, I am. You just don't feel it.

516
00:41:51,091 --> 00:41:52,301
Maybe I'm getting lovesick.

517
00:41:52,384 --> 00:41:54,261
I need a hug to make me feel better.

518
00:41:56,013 --> 00:42:00,017
Damian! [chuckles]
I'm not playing games here.

519
00:42:01,101 --> 00:42:03,687
Wait, what if does get worse?

520
00:42:03,771 --> 00:42:05,439
Do I need to stay and take care of you?

521
00:42:06,982 --> 00:42:09,777
You don't have to. I can handle myself.

522
00:42:10,486 --> 00:42:12,905
-You should go.
-Are you sure?

523
00:42:13,531 --> 00:42:16,534
All right. But I'll get you
some medicine first.

524
00:42:16,617 --> 00:42:18,911
I have to make sure
you take it before I go.

525
00:42:19,286 --> 00:42:21,830
I think a kiss will do the trick.

526
00:42:21,914 --> 00:42:22,915
Even just one.

527
00:42:25,918 --> 00:42:26,919
[snickers]

528
00:42:28,045 --> 00:42:29,213
You're so silly, Damian.

529
00:42:29,296 --> 00:42:32,174
Well, I'll be going now.
Take care of yourself.

530
00:42:36,762 --> 00:42:38,597
[Lily] <i>Helena, my newfound friend!</i>

531
00:42:38,681 --> 00:42:40,641
Lily! [laughs]

532
00:42:40,724 --> 00:42:44,103
People of Ardiente, Helena here
is my new friend.

533
00:42:45,104 --> 00:42:47,773
You are so different from the Ardientes.

534
00:42:47,856 --> 00:42:50,025
You deserve a round of applause

535
00:42:50,109 --> 00:42:51,819
for everything you've been doing.

536
00:42:51,902 --> 00:42:54,780
You are so kind, Helena.
And because of that,

537
00:42:54,863 --> 00:42:59,326
I am more than willing to donate
and support your good cause.

538
00:42:59,410 --> 00:43:01,787
Oh, thank you so much, Lily.

539
00:43:01,870 --> 00:43:04,164
And I heard you've held, so many projects

540
00:43:04,248 --> 00:43:05,916
to help the people too.

541
00:43:07,334 --> 00:43:10,879
A good team-up with you would be perfect!

542
00:43:10,963 --> 00:43:12,047
-Yes!
-[Helena laughing]

543
00:43:12,131 --> 00:43:14,842
Miss Lily Cruz is
such a good person, isn't she?

544
00:43:14,925 --> 00:43:17,052
[woman] Yes, ma'am. She's so kind.

545
00:43:17,136 --> 00:43:21,056
Miss Lily Cruz is the one
who gave us back our land

546
00:43:21,140 --> 00:43:23,142
when the Ardientes took it from us.

547
00:43:23,225 --> 00:43:25,185
Just like you, Miss Helena,

548
00:43:25,269 --> 00:43:28,647
Miss Lily has held a lot
of projects for us here.

549
00:43:29,189 --> 00:43:30,733
[Danny] Lily and Helena working together?

550
00:43:30,816 --> 00:43:31,942
Onward, Ardiente!

551
00:43:32,026 --> 00:43:33,527
-[all] Onward, Ardiente!
-[Helena] Onward, Ardiente!

552
00:43:33,611 --> 00:43:36,322
-[Danny] Onward, Ardiente!
-[all] Onward, Ardiente!

553
00:43:37,197 --> 00:43:38,949
This is for each and every one of you.

554
00:43:49,251 --> 00:43:52,296
[foreboding music playing]

555
00:44:15,569 --> 00:44:17,488
[Lily] Just last week,

556
00:44:17,571 --> 00:44:21,950
Miss Helena Montoya
came here to Poblacion Ardiente

557
00:44:22,034 --> 00:44:27,247
and asked me to speak
in front of all of you

558
00:44:27,331 --> 00:44:30,334
so I could be a part of her advocacy.

559
00:44:31,752 --> 00:44:33,754
[applause]

560
00:44:38,550 --> 00:44:40,928
And because we are only private citizens

561
00:44:41,011 --> 00:44:44,682
who aren't affiliated
with any political parties,

562
00:44:44,765 --> 00:44:48,268
Helena Montoya
and I will be working together

563
00:44:48,352 --> 00:44:52,231
to push Poblacion Ardiente
to greater heights.

564
00:44:52,314 --> 00:44:53,690
That's why Miss Helena Montoya

565
00:44:53,774 --> 00:44:58,028
conducted a medical mission here today,

566
00:44:58,112 --> 00:45:00,864
and she will also be giving
medical assistance

567
00:45:00,948 --> 00:45:05,327
to other areas around Poblacion Ardiente.

568
00:45:05,411 --> 00:45:09,623
Along with that,
my mother Camia Cruz and I

569
00:45:09,706 --> 00:45:13,001
will be donating 5 million pesos

570
00:45:13,085 --> 00:45:16,839
to erect another clinic here
in Poblacion Ardiente.

571
00:45:16,922 --> 00:45:18,924
[applause]

572
00:45:25,556 --> 00:45:26,515
[Helena laughs]

573
00:45:29,017 --> 00:45:31,395
-[Emilia] Excuse me. Excuse me.
-[Helena] Thank you.

574
00:45:31,478 --> 00:45:33,856
[Emilia] I'm going to donate
10 million pesos.

575
00:45:35,357 --> 00:45:38,402
[dramatic music playing]

576
00:45:38,902 --> 00:45:39,903
Hi, Mama.

577
00:45:41,905 --> 00:45:43,824
I apologize. I think I misheard that.

578
00:45:43,907 --> 00:45:46,076
Was that 10 million pesos?

579
00:45:46,743 --> 00:45:49,913
Emilia, I didn't know
you were a magician now too.

580
00:45:49,997 --> 00:45:51,415
Call me whatever you want,

581
00:45:51,498 --> 00:45:54,001
but yes, I can do that,
so you can leave now.

582
00:45:54,084 --> 00:45:58,422
The real partner of my mother
has arrived, and that's me.

583
00:45:58,505 --> 00:46:00,924
[tense music playing]

584
00:46:05,220 --> 00:46:08,765
So, did you guys have fun
with the medical mission?

585
00:46:09,558 --> 00:46:11,977
[tense music playing]

586
00:46:12,060 --> 00:46:13,896
I'm sure, you'll have even more fun now

587
00:46:13,979 --> 00:46:17,441
because Emilia Ardiente-Torillo is here,

588
00:46:17,524 --> 00:46:20,652
the only daughter of Helena Montoya.

589
00:46:22,237 --> 00:46:26,033
[Lily] Your mother and I
are serious about this project.

590
00:46:26,492 --> 00:46:29,786
Well, I'm serious
about this too, Lily Cruz.

591
00:46:33,457 --> 00:46:37,586
You know, we should be discussing
about, um, first aid.

592
00:46:38,504 --> 00:46:42,049
Like, about… snake bites?

593
00:46:42,716 --> 00:46:46,803
You know, a lot of people here
pretend to be nice.

594
00:46:46,887 --> 00:46:49,806
You don't know when they'll
just kill you and bite you

595
00:46:49,890 --> 00:46:52,017
and poison you with their venom.

596
00:46:52,726 --> 00:46:55,145
That's so scary. Ouch.

597
00:46:56,230 --> 00:46:57,397
So, Mama,

598
00:46:57,481 --> 00:47:01,985
you better be careful
with the people around you.

599
00:47:02,069 --> 00:47:03,445
[laughs]

600
00:47:07,366 --> 00:47:08,367
[sighs]

601
00:47:08,575 --> 00:47:10,911
Thank you for the warning, Emilia.

602
00:47:11,870 --> 00:47:13,372
Helena, now you know.

603
00:47:13,914 --> 00:47:17,584
You need to be careful
around your own daughter.

604
00:47:21,630 --> 00:47:24,800
You know, Helena, I got
to know you, and I liked you.

605
00:47:24,883 --> 00:47:27,844
I felt our connection to help the people

606
00:47:27,928 --> 00:47:30,806
of Poblacion Ardiente. But I'm very sorry.

607
00:47:30,889 --> 00:47:33,850
Because I can't go on with this project

608
00:47:33,934 --> 00:47:36,895
if your daughter, Emilia, meddles in.

609
00:47:42,609 --> 00:47:45,362
I guess it'll be better if you two
work together on this project.

610
00:47:45,445 --> 00:47:48,115
Again, I'm sorry.

611
00:47:49,074 --> 00:47:49,992
Hey!

612
00:47:51,201 --> 00:47:53,120
-[Emilia] Hold the mic!
-[Lily] Guards.

613
00:47:54,830 --> 00:47:56,915
[tense music playing]

614
00:48:03,880 --> 00:48:04,965
Lily, wait.

615
00:48:11,263 --> 00:48:12,556
Lily, wait.

616
00:48:13,390 --> 00:48:15,559
Lily, please.

617
00:48:17,102 --> 00:48:18,103
[Lily exhales]

618
00:48:21,982 --> 00:48:23,984
[ominous music]

619
00:48:25,902 --> 00:48:26,903
Helena!

620
00:48:29,906 --> 00:48:31,992
[metal clanking]

621
00:48:37,914 --> 00:48:39,666
-[Lily] Are you okay?
-Yeah. Yeah.

622
00:48:39,750 --> 00:48:41,293
-Are you okay?
-Yeah. Yes.

623
00:48:41,376 --> 00:48:43,837
-[Lily] Helena, what--
-Thank you. Thank you.

624
00:48:43,920 --> 00:48:45,088
-Helena.
-Thank you.

625
00:48:45,172 --> 00:48:46,506
[indistinct chatter]

626
00:48:50,385 --> 00:48:52,429
Are you sure? You might have an injury.

627
00:48:53,347 --> 00:48:56,391
[action music playing]

628
00:49:04,024 --> 00:49:09,154
<i>Can I ask you a favor?</i>
<i>I want to call you Mama.</i>

629
00:49:09,237 --> 00:49:10,739
<i>Baby girl.</i>

630
00:49:12,741 --> 00:49:15,786
[Mercedes] <i>If you don't show up</i>
<i>to the operation later,</i>

631
00:49:15,869 --> 00:49:20,582
<i>this bullet will lodge itself in</i>
<i>the head of your beloved Camia.</i>

632
00:49:22,626 --> 00:49:25,462
[Lily] <i>Red Dragon</i>
<i>is making a shipment tonight.</i>

633
00:49:25,545 --> 00:49:27,839
[Diego] <i>I'll sabotage their delivery.</i>

634
00:49:27,923 --> 00:49:32,052
[Lily] <i>I have to find a way</i>
<i>to help Diego's plan succeed.</i>

635
00:49:32,761 --> 00:49:34,721
[woman] <i>There's something</i>
<i>different about you.</i>

636
00:49:36,807 --> 00:49:39,810
[theme music playing]
